# Parking Structure: Dead Mall, track 3 (SPEC 19.7). The roof deck at
# night, the lot lights still on their timer: gap jumps between the ramps
# on the north and south runs (miss one and you drop a level), the east
# side open to the drop, rain on the deck through the broken canopy (a
# slick), a sparking lot-light panel on the west wall, then down the
# levels through the middle of the deck and back to the line.
name PARKING DECK
order 3
floor deck
background deck
league dead_mall
width 50
# x    y    half   features
 250  140   54                     # start line, heading east
 500  130   54     ramp            # the north gap jump
 740  130   54
 880  200   52     open:left       # the east edge: the drop on the left
 900  420   52     open:left
 890  620   50     coolant         # rain on the deck
 850  820   50
 700  895   52     crates
 480  895   52     ramp            # the south gap jump
 280  895   52
 150  800   50
 140  620   48     vent:right,phase=90   # the lot-light panel sparks
 250  500   46
 500  520   46     crates          # down through the middle levels
 640  440   44
 560  330   44
 380  330   46     bay:right
 220  300   48
 150  220   50
props cart,neon seg 3 side left gap 110 off 30
props robot,cart seg 6 side right gap 80 off 22
props neon,vending seg 13 side both gap 90 off 22
props cart seg 10 side left gap 70 off 22
